Blobs from this tablet's stock firmware:
- firmware/cirrus/cs35l41-dsp1-spk-prot.{wmfw,bin}: CS35L41 speaker protection,
  from stock vendor /firmware/cs35l40-spk-dsp1-spk-prot.{wmfw,bin}
- firmware/cirrus/cs35l41-cal-11-004N.bin: speaker calibration of ONE tablet
  (sec_efs/cirrus: rdc, temp, vsc, isc as 4x u32 LE; amp 40=_r 41= 42=_br 43=_b).
  Other tablets should regenerate them from their own sec_efs.
